    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kehoe & Assoc. are delighted to present No. 39 Radharc na Mara, a most attractive three-bedroom semi-detached residence situated in this established and highly convenient residential development at Coolcotts, Wexford. Built in 2006 and extending to approximately 92 sq.m., this well-proportioned home has remained in the ownership of the original owner since new and offers comfortable accommodation with three bedrooms and three bathrooms.\r\n\r\nRadharc na Mara enjoys an excellent location on the outskirts of Wexford Town, combining the convenience of town living with easy access to a wide range of local amenities. Wexford Racecourse is close by, with its popular walking track providing an excellent recreational amenity for walking and exercise. Schools, shops, sporting facilities and everyday services are all within easy reach, while Wexford Town Centre is only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nThe property is particularly well positioned for commuters, with convenient access to the surrounding road network, including the N11/N25 and onward connections towards the M11 motorway, Dublin, New Ross, Waterford and Rosslare Europort. This accessibility, coupled with the established residential setting, makes No. 39 an excellent option for families, first-time buyers or those seeking a conveniently located home in Wexford.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and begins with a welcoming entrance hallway and guest w.c. The sitting room provides a comfortable living space centred around a solid-fuel stove, while the kitchen/dining room offers excellent everyday family accommodation with ample space for dining. The kitchen appliances are included in the sale.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the landing incorporates the hot-press and provides access via hatch to the attic. There are three bedrooms at this level, including a main bedroom with its own ensuite shower room, together with two further bedrooms and a family bathroom. Bedroom No. 3 enjoys an attractive outlook with views towards the River Slaney, adding an appealing feature to the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nWith its practical layout, convenient location and excellent connectivity, No. 39 Radharc na Mara represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-established three-bedroom home within easy reach of Wexford Town and the wider road network.\r\n\r\nIt is highly recommended, to arrange a suitable viewing time, please contact the sole selling agents, Kehoe & Assoc., at 053 9144393."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Storm Porch\t1.33m x 0.66m.\r\n\t\r\nEntrance Hallway\t4.83m x 2.42m\tTimber laminate flooring, ample space under staircase for coat rack and potential built in storage.\r\n\r\nDoor leading through to:\r\n\r\nSitting Room\t4.05m x 4.03m\tTimber laminate flooring throughout with solid fuel stove, timber mantel surround, tv points and plug points.\r\n\r\nDouble leading through to:\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t6.04m x 2.80m\tPart timber laminate flooring on the dining side, sliding door leading out to the south facing rear garden and lino flooring to the kitchen, fully fitted with floor and eye level cabinetry, ample worktop space, stainless steel sink and drainer with tiled splashback under large window overlooking south facing garden, Belling electric hob under extractor fan overhead, Belling double oven, Nordmende washing machine and Flavel dryer, Belling free standing fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nOff the Entrance Hallway door to:\r\n\r\nGuest Bathroom\t2.08m x 1.45m\tLino flooring, w.h.b with tiled splashback, and w.c.\r\n\r\nFrom the Entrance Hall, timber carpeted staircase leading to:\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: \t\t\r\n\t\t\r\nLanding \t2.94m x 2.08m\tCarpeted flooring, hot-press with insulated tank and open shelves offer ample storage space.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom  \t3.35mx 3.20m\tTimber laminate flooring throughout, large window with mountain and racecourse views.\r\n\r\nEnsuite\t2.57m x0.87m\tLino flooring, w.h.b with tiled splashback, enclosed shower with pvc panel surround and glass door, Triton T90 si and w.c.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \t3.83m x 2.81m\tCarpeted flooring throughout, large window overlooking rear gardens.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \t3.42m x 3.13m\tCarpeted flooring, large window overlooking front garden and cobble lock driveway with extensive views of Wexford Racecourse and River Slaney.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\t2.22m x 1.69m\tLino flooring, bath with showerhead, w.h.b with tiled splashback with mirror and lighting overhead, w.c and wall mounted cabinetry.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor Area: c. 92 sq.m / 990  sq.ft."
